---
source: xtask/src/help.rs
expression: help_for(&path)
---
Assemble the GitHub Pages tree: the book and the Rust API docs under <dir>/<version>/, the version list and the root redirect

Usage: cargo xtask docs assemble --version <latest|vX.Y> <DIR>

Arguments:
  <DIR>
          The output directory

Options:
      --version <latest|vX.Y>
          The docs version

  -h, --help
          Print help
